{%- comment -%}
  Local override hook (see docs/CUSTOMIZE.md "Adding a new publication"):
  the gem-owned bib.liquid layout includes this file for every entry, right
  after building the venue text, with `entry` in scope. We use it to show a
  Journal / Magazine / Conference / Demo / Patent badge, driven by the custom
  `pub_type` bibtex field set on every entry in _bibliography/papers.bib.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if entry.pub_type -%}
  {%- capture entrytype -%}{{ entrytype }} <span class="badge">{{ entry.pub_type }}</span>{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endif -%}
